></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-30T12:11:38-07:00","id":1554863,"title":"","content":"Leaving aside questions of rating, are there any tidbits of history that fill out Seattle as a setting? (I\u2019m especially interested in information touching on the era of my old correspondent <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3046_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3046\" data-vbnamecard=\"3046\">Black Fox</a>\u2019s Anarch Free States game.<br /> <br /> Are there any characters and setting elements worth bringing into VAMPIRE\u2019s Consensus Reality?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-30T13:05:43-07:00","id":1554866,"title":"","content":"IMO Fabien probably has the most potential as a character to pull into other projects. For all that BL1's take on the Malkavians is an enjoyed part of that game, Fabien is a nice alternate approach to the Clan. While BL2 is largely treated as a Cam game, Fabien feels kinda like Isaac from BL1 in mentality, and thus would be very easy to redo as an Anarch troubleshooter than cleans up after the more violent and iconclastic members of the Sect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-30T14:42:51-07:00","id":1554875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Atticus Cleanclaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1554554-an-old-1990s-gamer-s-opinion-on-bloodlines-2-review?p=1554863#post1554863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Leaving aside questions of rating, are there any tidbits of history that fill out Seattle as a setting? (I\u2019m especially interested in information touching on the era of my old correspondent <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3046_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3046\" data-vbnamecard=\"3046\">Black Fox</a>\u2019s Anarch Free States game.<br /> <br /> Are there any characters and setting elements worth bringing into VAMPIRE\u2019s Consensus Reality?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think they did a decent job with creating Seattle as a setting. With no spoilers about the in-game situation but spoilers for background.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> + Lou Graham and her sister Rosalind were the children of a 6th generation vampire that Embraced them both.<br /> + Lou caused the Seattle fire to wipe out much of the city's Elder Kindred and cover up the diablerie of her sire.<br /> + Lou built over Old Seattle and a lot of magical caerns and places of power were buried beneath.<br /> + The court of Seattle was eventually hit by a Hunter named Santiago who killed Rosalind and all the remaining court that opposed Lou ascending to Prince.<br /> + Lou Embraced her ghoul, JJ Campbell, who was a 1920s police chief and made him her Sheriff before making him Prince of the City when she &quot;retired.&quot;<br /> + Lou has been living in her hotel penthouse for decades like Ms. Havisham. She doesn't even hunt but has vessels brought to her.<br /> + JJ Campbell became fascinated by the Blood Trade and made a deal with a Thin Blood named Katsumi to allow Seattle to be a safe haven for Thin Bloods as long as he allowed them to make Alchemical Potions for Kindred.<br /> + Katsumi is a former surgeon branded with a M on her face. She is very much a consolidator but the brand makes her hate Campbell.<br /> + Thin Blooded Alchemy allows blood that is much more nourishing than regular Kine blood as well as actual superpowered blood. It's also addictive as hell and being distributed across the United States.<br /> + The city is INFESTED with Thin Bloods to an absurd degree. The Anarchs are also debating making a revolt against them because the problem has gotten so huge. The blood trade means independent ghouls are more common here than anywhere else too.<br /> + The seneschal, Ryong, is upset with Campbell's focus on the blood trade as he's using tens of millions of his legitimate businesses to finance the Tremere Safia's experiments with blood.<br /> + Benny the Brujah Sheriff wants to purge all the Anarchs in the city and hates that JJ is making too much money to care.<br /> + Benny is a psychopath with a very gentle caring Kindred father named Max.<br /> + The city has accepted some Lasombra in the city but Lou is the only one who approves them and only if they pledge loyalty to her.<br /> + There's no Tremere chantry but Mrs. Thorn runs a occult book shop and has gotten into the Blood Trade and magic trade herself. She calls herself &quot;Magistar&quot; but there's only one other Tremere in the city.<br /> + Ysabella is the local Toreador Primogen who runs a cult out of her nightclub, Atrium, and absolutely DETESTS the Masquerade.<br /> + The Ventrue Primogen, Fletcher, is a power in name only as Lou, Campbell, and Ryong all act without him. He runs a piano bar and basically just acts like an asshole to everyone.<br /> + Banu Haqim Niko lives with Toreador Patience in a pawn shop. Niko uses his job to find stories of desperation and executes those he judges to be evil. Patience makes sculptures from bones and murder victims' items.<br /> + Silky is a big Hells Angels looking guy who is actually a gay man and one of the modern Prometheans, being an incredibly well-read self-taught philosopher and anarchist who is loyal to the Camarilla. He's also lovers with a werewolf and believes Seattle has a spiritual wound that is corrupting it somewhere in the Underground.<br /> + The IAO is planning a major operation in the city but has absolute shit luck finding real Kindred but a lot of luck with Thin Bloods. Its led by Mother Hen, a Inquisitor who is dying of cancer and notably deciding that alternatives to death are within reach.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-30-2025, 05:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-31T00:47:57-07:00","id":1554887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1554554-an-old-1990s-gamer-s-opinion-on-bloodlines-2-review?p=1554875#post1554875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsBy